        "weight": "Regular",
        "sampleCopy": "Individuals, jobs, services and schemes exist in close proximity, but can't digitally discover each other. This 'paradox of proximity' is rooted in digital darkness, which prevents individuals, enterprises and entire districts from unlocking potential."
      }
